[00:01.28]
[00:01.28]I once wished to disappear
[00:09.06]我以前许愿消失于世上
[00:09.06]When the stares were burning me
[00:16.92]人们的视线把我灼穿
[00:16.92]I thought If I'd abandoned this flesh lived as consciousness
[00:26.62]我想着如果我能丢弃这副身体 只以意识的形态活着
[00:26.62]I might be beautiful too
[00:33.03]那也许我也会是美丽的
[00:33.03]Clearly know
[00:36.57]我清楚地知道
[00:36.57]In this vast cosmo
[00:40.57]在广袤的宇宙里
[00:40.57]I'm just a small mayfly
[00:49.20]我像蜉蝣一样渺小
[00:49.20]In the wake of a nova's light
[00:56.82]新星之光掠过后
[00:56.82]I felt invincible like I could reach to the sky
[01:07.18]我感到无所不能 仿佛能触摸到天际
[01:07.18]Starlight travels years and then finds its way to you
[01:16.12]星辉跨越无数光年
[01:16.12]Will my heartbeat ever reach you too?
[01:24.09]我的心跳什么时候也能抵达你的耳畔
[01:24.09]Just one look from you
[01:28.40]你仅凭一瞥
[01:28.40]Threw me in a quantum leap
[01:34.35]就把我坠入量子跃迁
[01:34.35]Blurred all that was and will be
[02:13.13]时空的序列由此坍缩
[02:13.13]At the thought of your existence
[02:20.55]只要想着你的存在
[02:20.55]My heart finds certainty
[02:27.56]就足够安心
[02:27.56]While it's the fantasies of seeing you once more
[02:37.04]但想要再次和你见面的执念
[02:37.04]Navigate my steps through countless starless nights
[02:47.15]牵引着我走过无数黑暗长夜
[02:47.15]After all this time I've found my way to the light
[02:56.09]走过漫长岁月 我终于抵达这光芒
[02:56.09]Am I now worthy to stand by your side?
[03:04.22]如今的我 能站在你的身边了吗
[03:04.22]If I disappear with our vow in solar flare
[03:14.37]如果我和我们的约定一同被太阳耀斑吞噬
[03:14.37]See the future for me please
[03:40.29]请替我去看我无法看见的未来
[03:40.29]If someday you wander
[03:43.56]如果将来你
[03:43.56]Through seasons I could never share
[03:47.46]漫步于我无缘共度的季节
[03:47.46]Forget me not
[03:57.21]不要忘记我
[03:57.21]Maybe I will also become somebody's light
[04:02.02]也许有天 我也会成为照亮别人的光
